detaileddescription.para:
Before calling any function on a key attribute structure, the application must initialize it by any of the following means:

Set the structure to all-bits-zero, for example: psa_key_attributes_tattributes;
memset(&attributes,0,sizeof(attributes));

Initialize the structure to logical zero values, for example: psa_key_attributes_tattributes={0};

Initialize the structure to the initializer PSA_KEY_ATTRIBUTES_INIT, for example: psa_key_attributes_tattributes=PSA_KEY_ATTRIBUTES_INIT;

Assign the result of the function psa_key_attributes_init() to the structure, for example: psa_key_attributes_tattributes;
attributes=psa_key_attributes_init();
